mal\"><span>杠杆</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>齿轮</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>斜面</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>滑轮</span></p>"}],"a":"A","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["省力杠杆和费力杠杆","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]},{"i":"8932","no":10,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">如图，下列说法正确的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866760873533440.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>这是齿轮传动</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>这是链传动</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>两个轮子转向相反</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>这是蜗轮蜗杆</span></p>"}],"a":"B","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["链传动和带传动的概念","带传动和链传动各自的优缺点"]},{"i":"8933","no":11,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列机构不能省力的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>斜面</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>定滑轮</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>动滑轮</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>杠杆</span></p>"}],"a":"B","an":"<p>分析简单机械的工作原理，判断其是否通过改变力的作用方式来减小所需施加的力。斜面通过延长作用距离分散阻力，实现省力效果；动滑轮通过分担负载重量改变力的分配关系，降低输入力需求；杠杆利用支点位置调节力臂长度，使输入力小于输出力；定滑轮仅改变力的方向，不改变力的大小，作用过程中输入力与输出力相等，未形成力的增益机制。</p>","sc":2.0,"kp":["动滑轮、定滑轮的特点","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]},{"i":"8934","no":12,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">如图，这是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866760827396096.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>齿轮垂直啮合</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>齿轮平行啮合</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>蜗轮蜗杆传动</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>链传动</span></p>"}],"a":"B","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["齿轮平行啮合","不同种类的齿轮","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"8935","no":13,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列齿轮组起加速作用的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">主动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">18</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿，从动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿</font></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">主动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿，从动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">18</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿</font></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">主动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">18</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿，从动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">18</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿</font></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">主动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿，从动轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font><font face=\"宋体\">齿</font></span></p>"}],"a":"A","an":"<p>计算齿轮组传动比，传动比等于主动轮齿数与从动轮齿数的比值。当传动比小于1时，表示从动轮转速高于主动轮，实现加速效果。比较各组合的齿数关系，确定传动比是否小于1。</p>","sc":2.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"8936","no":14,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列哪个建筑不是三角形结构？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866760936448000.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"a"},{"l":"B","c":"b"},{"l":"C","c":"c"},{"l":"D","c":"d"}],"a":"C","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知"]},{"i":"8937","no":15,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下图中有几个定滑轮</font><font face=\"Calibri\">? </font><font face=\"宋体\">（ ）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866760995168256.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">0</font><font face=\"宋体\">个</font></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">个</font></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">个</font></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">3</font><font face=\"宋体\">个</font></span></p>"}],"a":"D","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["动滑轮、定滑轮的特点"]},{"i":"8938","no":16,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">如图，以下哪个工具是费力杠杆？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866761049694208.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"a"},{"l":"B","c":"b"},{"l":"C","c":"c"},{"l":"D","c":"d"}],"a":"C","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["省力杠杆和费力杠杆"]},{"i":"8939","no":17,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">关于履带说法正确的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>使用履带会让车体容易打滑</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>使用履带有助于防滑</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>履带会增大车体对地面的压强</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>履带的长度无法调节</span></p>"}],"a":"B","an":"<p>分析履带与地面接触面积对摩擦力的影响机制；考察履带结构对车体与地面间压强分布的作用方式；探讨履带在不同地形条件下的运动特性表现；检查履带长度调节设计在机械结构上的实现可能性。</p>","sc":2.0,"kp":["机器人常用底盘（轮式及履带）"]},{"i":"8940","no":18,"t":1,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">如图，使用镊子时相当于使用费力杠杆，它的支点是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.lianke